hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"160","Lā ba'sa ṭahūrun in shā Allāh. ¤ ¤ Do not worry, it will be a purification (for you), Allah willing."
"161","As'alullāha ‘l-`Aẓīma Rabba ‘l-`Arshil-`Aẓīmi an yashfiyak. ¤ ¤ I ask Almighty Allah, Lord of the Magnificent Throne, to make you well. (Recite seven times in Arabic .)"
